    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Protean fox&quot; is a bullet-hell shooting game that combines relaxation and challenge. In the game, players take on the role of an adorable spirit fox, using firearms, magical artifacts, and spells to battle various monsters across diverse worlds. Along the way, they can meet more pet companions and search for the lost Spirit Fox Fire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome all spirit foxes to join the official game Discord:\u00a0  Share your suggestions and feedback with us! Perhaps you could be the designer of the next pet companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/9eeab8f71c7640f461bf9ffb8d0c0173.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/301e10687a63d1c36cf475d295879f2d.avif?t=1750229394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Fox Domain</strong>: In the ancient and mysterious Eastern realm, deftly wield celestial artifacts and mechanisms to explore the fairyland and spirit world, uncovering the origins of the spirit foxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Wasteland</strong>: In a post-apocalyptic world of technological collapse, engage in fierce battles with mutated creatures using firearms and modular tech, searching for hope to save the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Century</strong>: In a world where magic and combat skills intertwine, dance with elves and vampires, writing your own legendary epic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the spirit fox as you battle across three distinct worlds, each featuring unique weapons, enemies, pets, and boss challenges! Pet rooms, hostage rooms, lottery machines... countless random rooms await your exploration!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/4566f1265bc91a8f23c5f6d4e1fd8426.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ea87dfaa85b6b4906620f5237f99ce64.avif?t=1750229394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, each pet has different evolutionary stages. Explore the levels to capture various pets, nurture them to unlock more powerful skills, and even the boss monsters in each level may become valuable allies on the Spirit Fox's journey!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/77f24b2b3323d687005772f09fab64a2.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As the protagonist of the game, the little Spirit Fox possesses ever-changing abilities. In the game, the Spirit Fox can switch between multiple forms, each offering unique gameplay mechanics. Combine different forms with weapons and pets to build your ultimate playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/abab8a67f259f3875a39827d20be45c8.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Across different worlds, the versatile Spirit Fox masters a variety of weapons. In the game, weapons are divided into three categories: <strong>Celestial Artifacts</strong>, <strong>Magic</strong>, and <strong>Firearms</strong>. Each type also has a corresponding off-hand item for combination\u2014<strong>Mechanisms</strong> paired with Celestial Artifacts, <strong>Modules</strong> equipped on Firearms, and <strong>Battle Skills</strong> fused with Magic\u2014all of which unlock endless possibilities for the Spirit Fox's combat! Additionally, as the Spirit Fox progresses through levels, it will acquire various <strong>random magical treasures</strong> that provide attribute boosts, introducing even more gameplay-altering strategies!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Protean fox&quot; is a bullet-hell shooting game that combines relaxation and challenge. In the game, players take on the role of an adorable spirit fox, using firearms, magical artifacts, and spells to battle various monsters across diverse worlds. Along the way, they can meet more pet companions and search for the lost Spirit Fox Fire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome all spirit foxes to join the official game Discord:\u00a0  Share your suggestions and feedback with us! Perhaps you could be the designer of the next pet companion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/9eeab8f71c7640f461bf9ffb8d0c0173.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/301e10687a63d1c36cf475d295879f2d.avif?t=1750229394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Fox Domain</strong>: In the ancient and mysterious Eastern realm, deftly wield celestial artifacts and mechanisms to explore the fairyland and spirit world, uncovering the origins of the spirit foxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Wasteland</strong>: In a post-apocalyptic world of technological collapse, engage in fierce battles with mutated creatures using firearms and modular tech, searching for hope to save the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Century</strong>: In a world where magic and combat skills intertwine, dance with elves and vampires, writing your own legendary epic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the spirit fox as you battle across three distinct worlds, each featuring unique weapons, enemies, pets, and boss challenges! Pet rooms, hostage rooms, lottery machines... countless random rooms await your exploration!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/e429d1c61506c5ddaad70659d4551085.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/4566f1265bc91a8f23c5f6d4e1fd8426.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ea87dfaa85b6b4906620f5237f99ce64.avif?t=1750229394\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game, each pet has different evolutionary stages. Explore the levels to capture various pets, nurture them to unlock more powerful skills, and even the boss monsters in each level may become valuable allies on the Spirit Fox's journey!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/77f24b2b3323d687005772f09fab64a2.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/c6036fb37344f9952c0173cce9e18775.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >As the protagonist of the game, the little Spirit Fox possesses ever-changing abilities. In the game, the Spirit Fox can switch between multiple forms, each offering unique gameplay mechanics. Combine different forms with weapons and pets to build your ultimate playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/abab8a67f259f3875a39827d20be45c8.avif?t=1750229394\" width=689 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/f2d27a97b5d6d15fdee3e7919285d4da.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.poster.avif?t=1750229394\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.webm?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829700/extras/ffa578ace13f887796f8c6d67c57d663.mp4?t=1750229394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Across different worlds, the versatile Spirit Fox masters a variety of weapons. In the game, weapons are divided into three categories: <strong>Celestial Artifacts</strong>, <strong>Magic</strong>, and <strong>Firearms</strong>. Each type also has a corresponding off-hand item for combination\u2014<strong>Mechanisms</strong> paired with Celestial Artifacts, <strong>Modules</strong> equipped on Firearms, and <strong>Battle Skills</strong> fused with Magic\u2014all of which unlock endless possibilities for the Spirit Fox's combat! Additionally, as the Spirit Fox progresses through levels, it will acquire various <strong>random magical treasures</strong> that provide attribute boosts, introducing even more gameplay-altering strategies!</h2>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Protean Fox&quot; is a bullet shooting game that combines elements of creature capture and light roguelike gameplay. Players will take on the role of a girl who gains the power of the Protean Fox. In her quest to reclaim the Foxfire, she wields weapons and magical artifacts from different worlds.",
